Education	12th pass, aage business aur marketing ki skills seekh raha hai
Occupation	Young learner, import-export business seekh raha hai aur apne goal par kaam kar raha hai
Income	Family support (pocket money aur kharche family se aate hain)
Device	Mid-range Android smartphone, 5G/4G data plan

Interests:
Business aur entrepreneurship, import-export aur global trade, digital marketing, personal finance, motivational content, startup success stories, networking aur self-improvement.

